#. module: ag_invoice_overdue_reminder
#: model:mail.template,body_html:ag_invoice_overdue_reminder.mail_template_overdue_reminder
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"    <p>Hello<t t-if=\"not object.partner_id.is_company\"> <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or ''\"></t></t>,</p>\n"
"    <p>Unless we missed your payment, invoice <strong t-out=\"object.name or ''\"></strong>\n"
"        was due on <t t-out=\"format_date(object.invoice_date_due) or ''\"></t>.\n"
"        The amount still open is <strong t-out=\"format_amount(object.amount_residual, object.currency_id) or ''\"></strong>.</p>\n"
"    <p>You can view and pay it online here:</p>\n"
"    <p><a t-att-href=\"object.get_portal_url()\" style=\"background-color:#875A7B;padding:8px 16px;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;text-decoration:none;\">View the invoice</a></p>\n"
"    <p>If you already paid, please ignore this message. Thank you!</p>\n"
"    <p>Best regards,<br><t t-out=\"object.company_id.name or ''\"></t></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"    <p>Bonjour<t t-if=\"not object.partner_id.is_company\"> <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name or ''\"></t></t>,</p>\n"
"    <p>Sauf erreur de notre part, la facture <strong t-out=\"object.name or ''\"></strong>\n"
"        était à régler pour le <t t-out=\"format_date(object.invoice_date_due) or ''\"></t>.\n"
"        Le montant encore ouvert est de <strong t-out=\"format_amount(object.amount_residual, object.currency_id) or ''\"></strong>.</p>\n"
"    <p>Vous pouvez la consulter et la régler en ligne ici :</p>\n"
"    <p><a t-att-href=\"object.get_portal_url()\" style=\"background-color:#875A7B;padding:8px 16px;color:#fff;border-radius:5px;text-decoration:none;\">Voir la facture</a></p>\n"
"    <p>Si votre paiement est déjà parti, merci de ne pas tenir compte de ce message.</p>\n"
"    <p>Cordialement,<br><t t-out=\"object.company_id.name or ''\"></t></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "

#. module: ag_invoice_overdue_reminder
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ag_invoice_overdue_reminder.field_account_bank_statement_line__overdue_reminder_next
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ag_invoice_overdue_reminder.field_account_move__overdue_reminder_next
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ag_invoice_overdue_reminder.field_account_payment__overdue_reminder_next
msgid ""
"Day the next reminder will be e-mailed if the invoice is still unpaid. Empty"
" when none is planned: invoice paid, reminders stopped, maximum reached or "
"customer without e-mail."
msgstr ""
"Date d'envoi du prochain rappel si la facture reste impayée. Vide quand "
"aucun n'est prévu : facture payée, rappels arrêtés, maximum atteint ou "
"client sans e-mail."

#. module: ag_invoice_overdue_reminder
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ag_invoice_overdue_reminder.field_res_company__overdue_reminder_days
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ag_invoice_overdue_reminder.field_res_config_settings__overdue_reminder_days
msgid "Days between reminders"
msgstr "Jours entre deux rappels"

#. module: ag_invoice_overdue_reminder
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ag_invoice_overdue_reminder.field_res_company__overdue_reminder_first_days
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ag_invoice_overdue_reminder.field_res_config_settings__overdue_reminder_first_days
msgid ""
"Days of grace after the due date before the first reminder: a transfer made "
"on the due date takes a few days to reach your bank statement."
msgstr ""
"Délai après l'échéance avant le premier rappel : un virement fait le jour de"
" l'échéance met quelques jours à apparaître sur votre relevé bancaire."

#. module: ag_invoice_overdue_reminder
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ag_invoice_overdue_reminder.res_config_settings_view_form_overdue_reminder
msgid "E-mail customers automatically when an invoice is overdue"
msgstr ""
"Envoyez automatiquement un e-mail aux clients dont une facture est en retard"

#. module: ag_invoice_overdue_reminder
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ag_invoice_overdue_reminder.res_config_settings_view_form_overdue_reminder
msgid "First reminder"
msgstr "Premier rappel"

#. module: ag_invoice_overdue_reminder
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ag_invoice_overdue_reminder.field_res_company__overdue_reminder_first_days
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ag_invoice_overdue_reminder.field_res_config_settings__overdue_reminder_first_days
msgid "First reminder after (days)"
msgstr "Premier rappel après (jours)"

#. module: ag_invoice_overdue_reminder
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ag_invoice_overdue_reminder.field_res_company__overdue_reminder_start_date
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ag_invoice_overdue_reminder.field_res_config_settings__overdue_reminder_start_date
msgid ""
"Invoices due before this date are never reminded automatically. It is set to"
" the day the module is installed, so that old unpaid invoices are not chased"
" by surprise."
msgstr ""
"Les factures échues avant cette date ne sont jamais relancées "
"automatiquement. La date est fixée au jour d'installation du module, pour "
"que les anciennes factures impayées ne soient pas relancées par surprise."

